TASKMAN - the task manager

  TASKMAN               every slot live, on a green screen
  TASKMAN VDU id key    and on VDU screen id too (a browser)

Each slot: its state, its program, its share of the
machine (CPU%: its turns in the last second out of
everyone's) as a bar, and its turns, BDOS calls and
characters a second. Then the memory in use.

  Up / Down   pick a slot (the one marked >)
  1-9, 0      pick slot 1-9, 10
  K           kill its program
  P           pause it / let it go on
  F           bring it to the front
  R           reset it
  Q or ESC    quit

On a VDU screen the bars are solid and the rows and the
buttons at the foot can be tapped. The server is RVDU's
(RVDU SERVER url); RVDU NEW makes a screen and its key.
